# Disclaimer policy

Every public FlyGACA surface must state that it is independent and **not affiliated with GACA**, in both languages on the same page.

English (keep the negation):

> Fly GACA is an independent educational platform, not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by GACA or the Government of Saudi Arabia. GACA (gaca.gov.sa) is always the authoritative source.

Arabic (must include the negation, not only "independent"):

> فلاي قاكا منظومة تعليمية مستقلة، غير تابعة لهيئة الطيران المدني (GACA) وغير مرتبطة بها ولا معتمدة منها. هيئة الطيران المدني هي المصدر الرسمي.

Rules:

- Never weaken "not affiliated with" to "independent" alone. The negation is the requirement.
- Keep the disclaimer above the first regulatory claim or citation.
- In Arabic, "منظومة تعليمية مستقلة" alone is not enough. Use غير تابعة / غير مرتبطة / لا تتبع / لا علاقة.
- `node scripts/gate.mjs` must report zero `disclaimer` findings before a content PR is ready.
